feat(ux): add expanded-bar grip drag, pin toggle and drag-shortcut-to-ribbon

Implement three UX improvements for the expanded dock bar:
- Bind GripDragHandle (⋮) in MainWindow.xaml to PressDragBehavior.Command so users can dock/undock while the bar is expanded.
- Add IsPinned / TogglePinCommand (📌) in DockInteractionController and DockBarViewModel plus DragStartedCommand/DragEndedCommand suspension around internal DoDragDrop so the bar never collapses prematurely while dragging shortcuts.
- Support dragging a shortcut from the main bar (or another ribbon) onto any ribbon tile button or RibbonPanel via AcceptInternalShortcutCommand / MoveToRibbonCommand.
- Add Spanish/English tooltips in LocalizedStrings and 6 new unit/contract tests (498/498 passing in Debug and Release).

Refs: RF01, RF02, RF04, HU01, HU04, E5-CA4, E5-CA5